cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software as a synthetic research-planning demonstration, not an animal experiment."
title: "JOMIZOO hamster bedding research: synthetic planning and analysis"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
authors:
  - name: "JOMIZOO research contributors"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - experimental design
  - hamster bedding
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free simulator, validator, and analysis demonstration for two
  provisional hamster-bedding study designs. All included records are explicitly
  synthetic. No animal observations, ethical approval, product efficacy, or
  sample-size justification are claimed.
